==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Flashfire|Carbink|68}} from the {{TCG|Flashfire}} expansion.
*'''Hard Roll''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Shelgon|108}} from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

